WEEK 17 — INSTALLABLE APP, TESTING AND FINAL REPORT

Date: Monday, 30 November 2026

Problem: The app had to install on phones and open offline, but a cached API could show stale prices and bills.

Solution:
- Added a web app manifest with icons, so the app installs from the browser.
- The service worker caches only the app shell; API calls always go to the network.
- The tests hit the cashier login limit, so the suite signs in once and reuses the token.
- Rebuilt all UML diagrams with the new features and wrote the viva guide.
- Result: 25 of 25 tests pass, lint and build are clean, and the final report is complete.
